cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the software and the article on the method of the combined importance-performance map analysis."
type: software
title: "cIPMA: Combined Importance-Performance Map Analysis"
abstract: >-
  R package that combines the importance-performance map analysis of a PLS-SEM
  model, estimated with seminr, with Quantile Necessary Condition Analysis of
  each predictor, computed with qnca.
